{"articleNo":"481627","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=481627&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] 근로자의 날 도서관 자료실 휴실 안내","writer":"도서관","writeDate":"2024.04.26","hit":"9052","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">근로자의 날이 휴업일로 지정됨에 따라 도서관 자료실을 다음과 같이 휴실합니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">1.&nbsp;휴실날짜:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 18pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">2024. 5. 1.(수)[근로자의 날]</span></span></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">2.&nbsp;휴실대상:&nbsp;도서관 자료실(1․2자료실,&nbsp;연속간행물실,&nbsp;전자정보실)</span></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">3.&nbsp;도서반납:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 18pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">도서관&nbsp;1층 입구 무인도서반납함 이용</span></span></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 18pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;※&nbsp;반납예정일이&nbsp;5.1.(수)인 도서는&nbsp;5.2.(목)로 일괄 변경됨</span></span></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">4.&nbsp;참고사항:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 18pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">일반열람실은 정상 운영함</span></span></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; font-size: medium; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">도 서 관 장</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
